faculty geometry from opencv {
    shape Quad = four Points clockwise

    can perspective-crop Image through Quad -> Image
    can move Quad by Vector within Image
    can move corner of Quad by Vector within Image
    can move edge of Quad by Vector within Image
    can expand Quad by Pixels within Image
    can test Point inside Quad
}

law EditableFrame {
    corners form convex Quad
    every edge longer than 20px
    every corner remains inside scan
    dragging an edge preserves that edge vector
    dragging whole frame preserves its shape
}

preference SafeCrop {
    losing original photo pixels hurts strongly
    keeping narrow scanner background hurts faintly
}

when frame changes {
    enforce EditableFrame
    prefer SafeCrop
}
